; Rushing Beat Shura encoding table for retrotool.
; F7-FB: 2-byte controls (opcode + 1 param).
; FC:    3-byte default, FC 02 xx yy = 4 bytes (only sub-cmd 02 is 4-byte).
; FD/FE: 1-byte standalone.
; FF:    1-byte standalone STOP + entry terminator.
; FA NOT in @ctrl_prefix — kept as multi-byte char prefix (page-2 kanji).
@ctrl_prefix F7 F8 F9 FB FC FD FE FF
@ctrl F7=2
@ctrl F8=2
@ctrl F9=2
@ctrl FB=2
@ctrl FC=3
@ctrl FC.02=4
@ctrl FD=1
@ctrl FE=1
@ctrl FF=1

